  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of a joint recovery needs assessment could be framed as: ?	To support the Government of Azerbaijan in the assessment of recovery and reconstruction needs, related strategic and programmatic priorities, and associated financial requirements in the three districts, aligned with key government strategies and plans. ?	To provide an inclusive process with the participation of national and international development partners for identification of recovery priorities in the three distric</narrative>
  </description>
